{"seq":3,"slug":"services-and-ingress","title":"Service 与 Ingress","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/services-and-ingress","wordCount":814,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"service-与-ingress\">Service 与 Ingress</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Pod IP 是临时的，重建后即变化，因此需要稳定入口。<strong>Service</strong> 为一组 Pod 提供固定虚拟 IP 与负载均衡，通过 <code>selector</code> 标签选择后端，由 kube-proxy 维护转发规则。按访问范围分为 ClusterIP（集群内）、NodePort（节点端口）、LoadBalancer（云平台入口）和 ExternalName 四种类型。</p>\n<p><strong>Ingress</strong> 工作在 HTTP/HTTPS 层，按域名与路径将外部流量路由到不同 Service，需配合 Ingress Controller 才能生效。此外，<strong>NetworkPolicy</strong> 以 Pod 为单位控制进出流量，实现微服务级网络隔离。三者构成 Kubernetes 的服务发现与流量入口体系。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"service-概述\">Service 概述</h2><p>Kubernetes 中的 Pod IP 地址是临时的，Pod 重建后 IP 会变化。Service 为一组 Pod 提供稳定的访问入口和负载均衡，是 Kubernetes 服务发现的核心机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: api-service&#10;spec:&#10;  selector:&#10;    app: api-server&#10;  ports:&#10;    - port: 80&#10;      targetPort: 3000&#10;      protocol: TCP&#10;  type: ClusterIP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-server</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      targetPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TCP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterIP</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    CLIENT[客户端] --&gt;|api-service:80| SVC[Service&lt;br/&gt;ClusterIP]&#10;    SVC --&gt;|负载均衡| POD1[Pod 1&lt;br/&gt;:3000]&#10;    SVC --&gt;|负载均衡| POD2[Pod 2&lt;br/&gt;:3000]&#10;    SVC --&gt;|负载均衡| POD3[Pod 3&lt;br/&gt;:3000]\">graph TD\n    CLIENT[客户端] --&gt;|api-service:80| SVC[Service&lt;br/&gt;ClusterIP]\n    SVC --&gt;|负载均衡| POD1[Pod 1&lt;br/&gt;:3000]\n    SVC --&gt;|负载均衡| POD2[Pod 2&lt;br/&gt;:3000]\n    SVC --&gt;|负载均衡| POD3[Pod 3&lt;br/&gt;:3000]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Service 核心概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>selector</td>\n<td>通过标签选择后端 Pod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ClusterIP</td>\n<td>集群内部虚拟 IP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Endpoints</td>\n<td>匹配 selector 的 Pod IP 列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kube-proxy</td>\n<td>维护 iptables/IPVS 转发规则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl get service api-service&#10;&#10;kubectl describe service api-service&#10;&#10;kubectl get endpoints api-service\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> service</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> service</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> endpoints</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-service</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"service-类型\">Service 类型</h2><p>Kubernetes 提供四种 Service 类型，适用于不同的网络访问场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Service 类型层次&#10;        CI[ClusterIP&lt;br/&gt;集群内部访问]&#10;        NP[NodePort&lt;br/&gt;节点端口暴露]&#10;        LB[LoadBalancer&lt;br/&gt;云平台负载均衡]&#10;        EXT[ExternalName&lt;br/&gt;外部 DNS 映射]&#10;        CI --&gt; NP --&gt; LB&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Service 类型层次\n        CI[ClusterIP&lt;br/&gt;集群内部访问]\n        NP[NodePort&lt;br/&gt;节点端口暴露]\n        LB[LoadBalancer&lt;br/&gt;云平台负载均衡]\n        EXT[ExternalName&lt;br/&gt;外部 DNS 映射]\n        CI --&gt; NP --&gt; LB\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"clusterip\">ClusterIP</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: internal-api&#10;spec:&#10;  type: ClusterIP&#10;  selector:&#10;    app: api&#10;  ports:&#10;    - port: 80&#10;      targetPort: 3000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">internal-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterIP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      targetPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"nodeport\">NodePort</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: web-nodeport&#10;spec:&#10;  type: NodePort&#10;  selector:&#10;    app: web&#10;  ports:&#10;    - port: 80&#10;      targetPort: 8080&#10;      nodePort: 30080\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-nodeport</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NodePort</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      targetPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      nodePort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30080</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"loadbalancer\">LoadBalancer</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: web-lb&#10;  annotations:&#10;    service.beta.kubernetes.io/aws-load-balancer-type: nlb&#10;spec:&#10;  type: LoadBalancer&#10;  selector:&#10;    app: web&#10;  ports:&#10;    - port: 443&#10;      targetPort: 8080\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-lb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    service.beta.kubernetes.io/aws-load-balancer-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nlb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LoadBalancer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">443</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      targetPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>访问范围</th>\n<th>端口范围</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ClusterIP</td>\n<td>集群内部</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>内部微服务通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NodePort</td>\n<td>节点 IP</td>\n<td>30000-32767</td>\n<td>开发测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LoadBalancer</td>\n<td>外部</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>生产环境入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ExternalName</td>\n<td>DNS 级别</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>外部服务集成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> LoadBalancer 类型在裸机环境中不可用（需要云平台支持）。裸机集群可以使用 MetalLB 项目提供 LoadBalancer 实现，或直接使用 Ingress Controller。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dns-服务发现\">DNS 服务发现</h2><p>Kubernetes 内置 DNS 服务（CoreDNS），为每个 Service 自动创建 DNS 记录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl exec -it debug-pod -- nslookup api-service&#10;&#10;kubectl exec -it debug-pod -- nslookup api-service.default.svc.cluster.local\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -it</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> debug-pod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nslookup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -it</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> debug-pod</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nslookup</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api-service.default.svc.cluster.local</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DNS 命名规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DNS 格式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&lt;service&gt;</code></td>\n<td>同命名空间访问</td>\n<td>api-service</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;service&gt;.&lt;namespace&gt;</code></td>\n<td>跨命名空间访问</td>\n<td>api-service.production</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;service&gt;.&lt;ns&gt;.svc.cluster.local</code></td>\n<td>完全限定域名</td>\n<td>api-service.default.svc.cluster.local</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;namespace: default&quot;&#10;        APP[app Pod] --&gt;|api-service| SVC1[api-service]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;namespace: monitoring&quot;&#10;        GRAF[grafana] --&gt;|api-service.default| SVC1&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"namespace: default\"\n        APP[app Pod] --&gt;|api-service| SVC1[api-service]\n    end\n    subgraph \"namespace: monitoring\"\n        GRAF[grafana] --&gt;|api-service.default| SVC1\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ingress-资源\">Ingress 资源</h2><p>Ingress 提供 HTTP/HTTPS 层面的路由规则，将外部流量根据域名和路径分发到不同的 Service。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: Ingress&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: app-ingress&#10;  annotations:&#10;    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-redirect: &#39;true&#39;&#10;    cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer: letsencrypt-prod&#10;spec:&#10;  ingressClassName: nginx&#10;  tls:&#10;    - hosts:&#10;        - app.example.com&#10;        - api.example.com&#10;      secretName: app-tls&#10;  rules:&#10;    - host: app.example.com&#10;      http:&#10;        paths:&#10;          - path: /&#10;            pathType: Prefix&#10;            backend:&#10;              service:&#10;                name: frontend&#10;                port:&#10;                  number: 80&#10;    - host: api.example.com&#10;      http:&#10;        paths:&#10;          - path: /v1&#10;            pathType: Prefix&#10;            backend:&#10;              service:&#10;                name: api-v1&#10;                port:&#10;                  number: 80&#10;          - path: /v2&#10;            pathType: Prefix&#10;            backend:&#10;              service:&#10;                name: api-v2&#10;                port:&#10;                  number: 80\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Ingress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-ingress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-redirect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'true'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">letsencrypt-prod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ingressClassName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#0